  "description": "SWIFT MT940 and MT942 bank statement parser for .NET. Parses end-of-day customer statements and intraday transaction reports into typed statements, balances, and statement lines: full :61: decomposition (value date, entry date with year rollover, reversal marks, funds code, references), comma-decimal amounts as decimal, multiline :86: information with a pluggable structured sub-field parser, balance reconciliation checks, multiple statements per file, block-wrapped or bare messages. Zero external dependencies.",
